<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>Predict the UV path</h2>
      <p>Imagine two identical Earths receiving the same harmful UV. One has more stratospheric ozone; one has less. Which ground receives less UV?</p>
      <freeform-block w="840" h="286">
        <box type="content" x="0" y="0" w="405" h="278" sizing="fixed" background-color="heading" style="border-radius: 18pt;"></box>
        <box type="content" x="435" y="0" w="405" h="278" sizing="fixed" background-color="heading" style="border-radius: 18pt;"></box>

        <box type="content" x="24" y="16" w="180" sizing="auto"><h3><span text-color="#F8FCFF">More ozone</span></h3></box>
        <box type="content" x="459" y="16" w="180" sizing="auto"><h3><span text-color="#F8FCFF">Less ozone</span></h3></box>

        <shape preset="ellipse" x="35" y="62" w="54" h="54" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="470" y="62" w="54" h="54" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape>

        <shape preset="line" x="132" y="73" w="2" h="102" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="line" x="184" y="73" w="2" h="102" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="line" x="236" y="73" w="2" h="102" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="line" x="567" y="73" w="2" h="102" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="line" x="619" y="73" w="2" h="102" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="line" x="671" y="73" w="2" h="102" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape>

        <box type="content" x="38" y="168" w="329" h="28" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius: 999pt;"></box>
        <box type="content" x="473" y="168" w="329" h="28" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius: 999pt;"></box>

        <shape preset="ellipse" x="94" y="174" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="139" y="174" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="184" y="174" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="229" y="174" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="274" y="174" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="565" y="174" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="694" y="174" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>

        <shape preset="ellipse" x="82" y="208" w="240" h="92" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="517" y="208" w="240" h="92" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <box type="content" x="116" y="224" w="172" sizing="auto"><h3 align="center">?</h3><p align="center" font-size="13pt">UV at the ground</p></box>
        <box type="content" x="551" y="224" w="172" sizing="auto"><h3 align="center">?</h3><p align="center" font-size="13pt">UV at the ground</p></box>
      </freeform-block>
      <p font-size="lg"><b>Point, vote and explain your reason.</b></p>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>